What you need to do
Fill .env (copied from .env.example) with ICICI Direct Breeze values:

ICICI_DIRECT_API_KEY=...
ICICI_DIRECT_API_SECRET=...
ICICI_DIRECT_SESSION_TOKEN=...   # daily API_Session from Breeze login

1. Customer login: https://secure.icicidirect.com/customer/login
2. Breeze API login: https://api.icicidirect.com/apiuser/login?api_key=<API_KEY>
3. Copy API_Session into ICICI_DIRECT_SESSION_TOKEN

Then run:

python -m backend.scripts.connect_icici_direct

You should get JSON with ok: true and has_session_token — no tokens printed.

Keep EXECUTION_MODE=shadow until you intentionally go live.
